# Phase 13A — keep the Docker build context small and free of secrets / client material.
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/dist
**/.turbo
**/coverage
**/*.log
**/tsconfig.tsbuildinfo
.git
.vscode
.idea
# never ship secrets or local overrides
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
!**/.env.*.example
**/*.pem
**/*.key
# local data
apps/api/storage
deploy/**/data
# proprietary client material and docs are not needed by any image
client-resources
docs
apps/web/verification
# API generated client is regenerated in the image
apps/api/src/generated
